{"sha": "cf66a166bf56fc2f5f335ac541ada87d84c2dbe1d6c1693c79f68a4f977f8c8d", "body": ["\\section{等效质子}", "", "\\begin{definition}[等效质子]\\label{def:g12:proton-nmr:equivalent}", "若质子在分子中处于相同的化学环境，则称它们为\\emph{等效质子}\\index{等效质子}，", "因而在相同位移处吸收，", "每组等效质子给出一个信号。", "同一 \\ce{CH3} 组中的三个质子总是等效的。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[计数基团]\\label{ex:g12:proton-nmr:groups}", "丙酮 \\ce{CH3-CO-CH3} 含六个质子，但只有一组：两个", "\\ce{CH3} 等同，分居 \\ce{C=O} 两侧。", "乙醇，\\ce{CH3-CH2-OH} 含三组（\\ce{CH3}、\\ce{CH2}、\\ce{OH}），而", "乙酸乙酯 \\ce{CH3-CO-O-CH2-CH3} 也有三组：其中 \\ce{CH3}", "与 \\ce{C=O} 相邻，\\ce{CH2} 与 \\ce{O} 相邻，以及", "末端的 \\ce{CH3}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{积分}", "", "\\begin{definition}[积分曲线]\\label{def:g12:proton-nmr:integration}", "核磁共振谱的\\emph{积分曲线}\\index{积分曲线}", "是画在信号上方的一条曲线，在每个信号处升高一个台阶：", "每个台阶的高度与给出该信号的", "质子数成正比。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[读取台阶]\\label{ex:g12:proton-nmr:steps}", "在乙醇的谱图中，三个信号上方的台阶从左到右分别为 2、", "1 和 3 个单位，依次对应 \\ce{CH2}、\\ce{OH} 和 \\ce{CH3}。只有", "比值才有意义：台阶为 12、6 和 18 mm 时，表示的是同一件事。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{裂分与 \\texorpdfstring{$n+1$}{n+1} 规则}", "", "", "\\begin{definition}[多重峰、$n+1$ 规则]\\label{def:g12:proton-nmr:multiplet}", "一个信号常被裂分为若干条靠近的谱线：\\emph{多重峰}\\index{多重峰}", "（单峰、双峰、三重峰、四重峰、\\dots{}，分别对应 1、2、3、4 条谱线）。由", "\\emph{$n+1$ 规则}\\index{$n+1$ 规则}可知，一组等效质子，", "其相邻碳原子上共带有 $n$ 个与之不等效的质子，", "则该组质子给出 $n+1$ 条谱线，其强度比", "遵循帕斯卡三角形。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[相邻质子引起的裂分]\\label{prop:g12:proton-nmr:n-plus-one}", "在分子 \\ce{CH3-CH2-X}（X 中不含氢）中，\\ce{CH3} 的信号", "为三重峰（相邻 2 个质子），\\ce{CH2} 的信号为四重峰", "（相邻 3 个质子）。与氧原子或氮原子相连的质子", "通常给出单峰，且不使相邻质子发生裂分。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在本阶段不加证明地承认：每个相邻质子依其自身状态使信号略微向高场或低场移动，", "各种组合给出 $n+1$ 条谱线；", "其物理原理见本科一年级分册。与 O 或 N 相连的质子", "在分子之间快速交换，从而平均掉了它们的影响。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % Pascal's triangle", "  \\foreach \\r/\\vals in {0/{1}, 1/{1,1}, 2/{1,2,1}, 3/{1,3,3,1}, 4/{1,4,6,4,1}} {", "    \\foreach \\v [count=\\i from 0] in \\vals", "      \\node at ({\\i*0.7 - \\r*0.35}, {-\\r*0.55}) {\\v};", "    \\node[anchor=east, font=\\footnotesize, black!60] at (-2.0,{-\\r*0.55}) {$n = \\r$};", "  }", "  % multiplets", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.2cm, yshift=-2.4cm]", "    \\foreach \\x/\\name/\\hs in {0/singlet/{1}, 1.4/doublet/{1,1}, 3.0/triplet/{1,2,1},", "                              4.9/quartet/{1,3,3,1}} {", "      \\foreach \\h [count=\\i from 0] in \\hs {", "        \\draw[very thick, omDef] ({\\x + \\i*0.22},0) -- ({\\x + \\i*0.22},{\\h*0.55});", "      }", "      \\node[anchor=north, font=\\footnotesize] at ({\\x+0.3},-0.1) {\\name};", "    }", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 帕斯卡三角形给出 $n+1$ 条谱线的相对强度，这些谱线", "来自被 $n$ 个相邻质子裂分的信号：1:1、1:2:1、1:3:3:1。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\newcommand{\\nmrpanel}[4]{% file part, title, xmax, ymax", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=\\linewidth, height=4.2cm, x dir=reverse, xmin=0,", "    xmax=#3, ymin=0, ymax=#4, ytick=\\empty, axis y line=none,", "    axis x line*=bottom, xlabel={化学位移 $\\delta$ (\\si{ppm})},", "    tick label style={font=\\scriptsize}, label style={font=\\scriptsize},", "    title={\\small #2}, title style={yshift=-3pt}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thin] table[x=delta, y=I] {figdata/out/grade-12-proton-nmr-#1.dat};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=delta, y expr=0.15+\\thisrow{integral}*0.11]", "    {figdata/out/grade-12-proton-nmr-#1.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}}", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\nmrpanel{a}{A: 乙醇}{5}{1.15}\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\nmrpanel{b}{B: 乙酸乙酯}{5}{1.15}\\end{minipage}", "", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\nmrpanel{c}{C: 丙酮}{5}{1.15}\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}\\nmrpanel{e}{D: 乙酸甲酯}{5}{1.15}\\end{minipage}", "", "\\begin{minipage}{\\linewidth}\\nmrpanel{d}{E: 丙酸}{12.5}{1.15}\\end{minipage}", "", "{\\small 质子核磁共振谱（蓝色）及其积分曲线", "（橙色；每个台阶的高度与其下方信号的", "质子数成正比）。化学位移取自 \\ce{CDCl3} 中实测的谱图；", "谱线形状与间距由简化模型绘制。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}